    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d75">

                <pb facs="0161" n="145" sameAs="frus:frus1949v02/pg145"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.93/8–1749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Clark</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canton</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-17T18:00:00+08:00">August 17, 1949—6
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Cantel 970. Acting Foreign Minister George
                    Yeh told me in strictest confidence this morning that Government is considering
                    raising <pb facs="0162" n="146" xml:id="pg146"/> with UN, as threat to world
                    peace, flagrant Soviet violation of letter and spirit Sino-Soviet treaty. There
                    is much opinion in Government, he said, that Government, having publicly taken
                    position Soviet violations, move would be good one.</p>
                <p>Although he did not specifically ask for Department’s reaction this contemplated
                    move, he asked me to report to him orally and in confidence any reaction thereto
                    I might receive. In other words, he would like to know what we think of it.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
